-**User-runnable resume syntax.** Whenever this reference tells the skill to print or copy a resume invocation, default to `/ce-babysit-pr <url>` and, when the run posture is not `target`, append the same `posture:stack-ready` or `posture:stack-land` token so checkpoint / durable / session re-entry keeps stack scope. Use `$ce-babysit-pr <url> [posture:…]` only when the active host is Codex or explicitly documents dollar-prefixed skill invocation. Render only the invocation as inline code and output one form only.
+**用户可运行的恢复语法。** 每当此引用告诉技能打印或复制恢复调用时，默认为`/ce-babysit-pr <url>`，并且当运行姿势不是`target`时，附加相同的`posture:stack-ready`或`posture:stack-land`令牌，以便检查点/持久/会话重新进入保持堆栈范围。仅当活动主机为 Codex 或明确记录以美元为前缀的技能调用时，才使用 `$ce-babysit-pr <url> [posture:…]`。仅将调用呈现为内联代码并仅输出一种形式。
 
-**Checkpoint:** Use checkpoint mode only when the user requests it or nothing can wake this agent. Run one tick, persist state, report, and print the exact host-rendered resume invocation. Say monitoring is paused. Never fake a loop with a foreground `sleep` or an unmanaged detached process.
+**检查点：** 仅当用户请求或没有任何东西可以唤醒此代理时才使用检查点模式。运行一次，保留状态，报告并打印准确的主机渲染的恢复调用。假设监控已暂停。切勿伪造带有前台 `sleep` 或非托管分离进程的循环。
 
-**Durability:** the in-session watch dies with the session. Re-invoking the skill resumes from disk, because `/tmp` persists across ticks. For an unattended multi-day watch, escalate to a durable scheduler: Grok's `scheduler_create --durable`, or cron running `<cli> exec '<host-rendered resume invocation>'`. A fresh headless run has no memory of this conversation, so persist consequential decisions to disk.
+**耐用性：** 会话中的手表会随着会话而消失。重新调用技能会从磁盘恢复，因为 `/tmp` 在各个刻度中持续存在。对于无人值守的多日监视，请升级为耐用的调度程序：Grok 的 `scheduler_create --durable`，或运行 `<cli> exec '<host-rendered resume invocation>'` 的 cron。新的无头运行没有此对话的记忆，因此将相应的决策保存到磁盘中。
 
-## Choosing the wake source
+## 选择唤醒源
 
-One wake source brings this agent back for each tick. Choose it once, before the first wait, from the host instructions and tools you have now:
+每次滴答时，一个唤醒源都会将该代理带回来。在第一次等待之前，从您现在拥有的主机说明和工具中选择一次：
 
-| What the host says about PR waits | Wake source |
+| 楼主所说的PR等待 | 唤醒源 |
 |---|---|
-| Its instructions dictate how they work, such as requiring its own PR-watch tool, forbidding polling or background watchers, or telling you to end the turn while waiting | The host's mechanism. Do not run the detector. |
-| Nothing, or it only offers an optional PR-watch tool | The detector, which sees more states than a host's event feed. Do not add the host's tool. |
-| Its instructions or tools leave this run no way to be woken, such as a delegated run that must not wait | Checkpoint, or in `mode:pipeline` one tick and return. |
+| 它的指令决定了它们的工作方式，例如需要它自己的 PR-watch 工具，禁止轮询或后台观察者，或者告诉你在等待时结束回合 | 主机机制。不要运行检测器。 |
+| 什么都没有，或者它只提供了一个可选的 PR-watch 工具 | 检测器可以看到比主机的事件源更多的状态。不要添加主机的工具。 |
+| 它的指令或工具使该运行无法被唤醒，例如不得等待的委托运行 | 检查点，或在 `mode:pipeline` 一次勾选后返回。 |
 
-Host instructions outrank this skill's default here. Never run both sources to satisfy both rules: that breaks the one-watcher boundary and produces duplicate wakes. Ending the turn is correct when an armed wake source will bring this agent back, and wrong when nothing will.
+此处，主机指令的优先级高于该技能的默认值。切勿运行两个源来满足这两个规则：这会打破单观察者边界并产生重复的唤醒。当武装唤醒源可以使该特工返回时，结束转弯是正确的，而当没有任何东西可以返回时，结束转弯是错误的。
 
-The wake source decides only how control returns. Every tick still starts from a fresh snapshot and still runs `ce-resolve-pr-feedback` and `ce-debug` as usual. Marks, posture, and true stops do not change. The report adds only which PR activity may go unnoticed.
+唤醒源仅决定控制权如何返回。每个刻度仍然从新快照开始，并且仍然像往常一样运行 `ce-resolve-pr-feedback` 和 `ce-debug`。标记、姿势和真实止损不会改变。该报告仅添加了哪些 PR 活动可能会被忽视。
 
-A host event is a reason to look, never a fact, whichever wake source is running. Any event, including one saying the PR merged, only prompts a fresh snapshot and an ordinary tick. The snapshot's `pr_state` decides. Under `stack-land`, this run's own land step stays a layer transition (`references/stack.md`). Ignore any wake that arrives after the run's report.
+无论哪个唤醒源正在运行，主机事件都是查看的原因，而不是事实。任何事件，包括 PR 合并的事件，都只会提示一个新的快照和一个普通的勾号。快照的`pr_state`决定。在 `stack-land` 下，此运行自己的土地步骤保持图层过渡 (`references/stack.md`)。忽略运行报告后出现的任何唤醒。
 
-When the host's mechanism is the wake source:
+当主机机制为唤醒源时：
 
-- **Run a complete tick before the first wait.** A host watch may wake only on events after it started, so feedback and failures already on the PR are yours to handle first. Follow the host's contract for arming: do not re-arm a watch that stays on after a wake.
-- **Snapshot again before ending the turn.** An event that lands during a tick may never produce a wake. If the fresh snapshot shows anything actionable, run another tick instead of waiting.
-- **Do not hold a wake to batch comments.** The comment coalescing window belongs to the detector. A burst of comments may cost extra resolver passes, and the marks keep those passes from repeating work. A wake whose fresh snapshot shows nothing actionable needs no resolver or debug pass, but still judge the stop conditions: no `merge-ready` wake will do it for you.
-- **Say what this source may miss.** A host may not wake on every feedback surface, on a branch falling behind its base, or when a clock runs out. A later wake's snapshot picks up anything missed, so nothing is lost while wakes keep coming. Whenever you report PR state, name any stream this host's wake does not clearly cover. `references/settle.md` says what to do when only a timed wait remains.
-- **Check the budget on every tick.** No detector will fire `max-runtime`. This mode counts wall-clock time, so compare `invocation_elapsed_seconds` with `invocation_budget_seconds` and take the budget stop when it is reached.
-- **Release it when the run stops watching this PR.** Release the host's watch at every true stop and at every managed-stack layer transition. A watch the host already removed, for example on merge, is not a failure.
+- **在第一次等待之前运行完整的滴答。** 主机手表可能仅在启动后发生事件时唤醒，因此 PR 上已有的反馈和故障由您首先处理。遵循主机的布防合同：请勿重新布防唤醒后仍保持开启状态的手表。
+- **结束回合之前再次快照。** 在滴答期间发生的事件可能永远不会产生唤醒。如果新快照显示任何可操作的内容，请运行另一个刻度而不是等待。
+- **不要唤醒批量评论。** 评论合并窗口属于检测器。大量评论可能会花费额外的解析器通行证，而标记可以防止这些通行证重复工作。其新鲜快照显示任何可操作内容的唤醒不需要解析器或调试通道，但仍会判断停止条件：没有 `merge-ready` 唤醒会为您做这件事。
+- **说出此源可能错过的内容。** 主机可能不会在每个反馈表面、落在其底座后面的分支上或时钟耗尽时唤醒。稍后的唤醒快照会拾取任何遗漏的内容，因此在唤醒持续出现时不会丢失任何内容。每当您报告 PR 状态时，请命名该主机的唤醒未明确涵盖的任何流。 `references/settle.md` 表示当只剩下定时等待时该怎么做。
+- **检查每个刻度的预算。** 探测器不会触发 `max-runtime`。此模式计算挂钟时间，因此将 `invocation_elapsed_seconds` 与 `invocation_budget_seconds` 进行比较，并在达到预算时停止。
+- **当运行停止监视此 PR 时释放它。** 在每次真正停止和每次托管堆栈层转换时释放主机的监视。监视已删除的主机（例如在合并时）并不是失败。
 
-## Cadence (the watch interval)
+## 节奏（观看间隔）
 
-- `pr-snapshot watch --interval` is the poll cadence: about 2-3 minutes while the PR is active, widened to about 5-10 minutes when it is quiet. The detector is cheap, but each poll is a `gh` call. Honor GitHub rate-limit reset headers and back off on `403`/`429`; claim→act→confirm makes resuming after a transient API error safe.
-- `--settle-seconds` (default 300) is the quiet window before a `merge-ready` wake. Leave it unset on the normal arm; the script's default is the initial policy. Only `references/settle.md` decides when to set it.
-- `--feedback-coalesce-seconds` (default 180) is the quiet window before a **comment-only** wake. Leave it unset on the normal arm. Waking on the first comment would spend a full `ce-resolve-pr-feedback` dispatch to conclude "status noise", and would split the ordinary sequence (push -> bots comment -> CI finishes) into two agent rounds. The candidates stay actionable while the window runs, so any other wake handles them in its tick; nothing is dropped, only deferred.
-- `--blocked-external-drain-seconds` is set only after an interactive approval-gate wake (`blocked-external`: CI is waiting on a human approval). Keep the active ~150s interval throughout this short 300/900/1800-second review drain: a quiet 5-10 minute poll could consume an entire tier before any signal arrives. The persisted head-scoped review clock decides expiry, not the arm time and not the broader merge-ready quiet clock.
-- A push or other mutation moves the head. Re-arm `watch` at the active cadence so it reads the new state.
-- Every re-arm presents the same `--invocation-id "$RUN_INVOCATION_ID" --session-started-at "$RUN_STARTED_AT" --invocation-budget-seconds "$RUN_BUDGET_SECONDS"`; the helper rejects a changed token, anchor, or budget. Only the first snapshot uses `--start-invocation`; only a managed-stack layer transition uses `--continue-invocation`.
+- `pr-snapshot watch --interval` 是轮询节奏：PR 活动时约为 2-3 分钟，安静时加宽至约 5-10 分钟。检测器很便宜，但每次轮询都是 `gh` 调用。荣誉GitHub速率限制重置标头并在`403`/`429`上退出；声明→行动→确认使得在短暂的 API 错误后恢复是安全的。
+- `--settle-seconds`（默认 300）是`merge-ready` 唤醒之前的安静窗口。让它在正常手臂上保持未设置状态；该脚本的默认值是初始策略。只有`references/settle.md`决定何时设置它。
+- `--feedback-coalesce-seconds`（默认 180）是 **仅评论** 唤醒之前的安静窗口。让它在正常手臂上保持未设置状态。在第一条评论上醒来将花费完整的 `ce-resolve-pr-feedback` 调度来结束“状态噪音”，并将普通序列（推送 -> 机器人评论 -> CI 完成）分为两轮代理。在窗口运行时，候选项保持可操作状态，因此任何其他唤醒都会在其滴答声中处理它们；没有任何东西被丢弃，只是被推迟。
+- `--blocked-external-drain-seconds` 仅在交互式批准门唤醒后设置（`blocked-external`：CI 正在等待人工批准）。在这段短暂的 300/900/1800-second 审查周期中保持活跃的约 150 秒间隔：安静的 5-10 分钟轮询可能会在任何信号到达之前消耗掉整个层。持久的头部范围审查时钟决定到期时间，而不是手臂时间，也不是更广泛的合并就绪安静时钟。
+- 推动或其他突变会移动头部。以活动节奏重新启动 `watch`，以便读取新状态。
+- 每次重新武装都呈现相同的`--invocation-id "$RUN_INVOCATION_ID" --session-started-at "$RUN_STARTED_AT" --invocation-budget-seconds "$RUN_BUDGET_SECONDS"`；助手拒绝更改的令牌、锚点或预算。只有第一个快照使用`--start-invocation`；只有托管堆栈层转换使用`--continue-invocation`。
 
-## Pipeline mode bound (`mode:pipeline`)
+## 管道模式绑定 (`mode:pipeline`)
 
-An orchestrator (`lfg`) drives ticks in-line and needs the loop to terminate. Run ticks back-to-back until one of the stops below. **To wait for CI to progress between ticks, use the harness's native non-blocking wait — never a bare foreground `sleep`** (blocked on Claude Code, discouraged elsewhere). Examples: Claude Code's `Monitor` until-loop; Grok's `get_command_or_subagent_output(timeout_ms=…)` or a `monitor`; Cursor's `Await` on a backgrounded `gh pr checks --watch`. When the host's instructions dictate PR waits and its wake returns to this session, arm that wake and end the turn; the wake resumes these ticks. If nothing can wake the run, do one tick and return control to the orchestrator rather than busy-spinning. Loop until:
+协调器 (`lfg`) 内联驱动刻度并需要终止循环。连续运行，直到下面的停止点之一。 **要等待 CI 在刻度之间进行，请使用该工具的本机非阻塞等待 - 绝不是裸露的前景 `sleep`** （在 Claude Code 上阻塞，在其他地方不鼓励）。示例：Claude Code 的 `Monitor` 直到循环； Grok 的 `get_command_or_subagent_output(timeout_ms=…)` 或 `monitor`；光标的`Await`位于背景`gh pr checks --watch`上。当主机指示 PR 等待并且其唤醒返回到此会话时，启动唤醒并结束回合；唤醒会恢复这些滴答声。如果没有任何东西可以唤醒运行，请执行一次滴答操作并将控制权返回给协调器，而不是忙于旋转。循环直到：
 
-- the pipeline stop in `references/pipeline.md` returns success or `needs-human`; it owns both gates. Anything short of them keeps ticking until it clears or the time budget expires; or
-- a **budget** is hit. The default is **3 CI fix rounds** per head-lineage and an overall time cap of about 30-45 minutes. When the budget runs out, the still-red checks and any `needs-human` items become residuals.
+- `references/pipeline.md`处的管道停止返回成功或`needs-human`；它拥有两个大门。任何缺少它们的东西都会继续滴答作响，直到它被清除或时间预算到期；或者
+- 达到了**预算**。默认为每个头谱系 **3 CI 修复回合**，总时间上限约为 30-45 分钟。当预算用完时，仍然是红色的支票和任何 `needs-human` 项目都会成为剩余。
 
-Never wait on the merge-ready settle window or human review in pipeline mode; those are interactive stops. A check stuck `IN_PROGRESS` past the time cap ends the run with a "CI still running" residual rather than blocking forever.
+切勿在管道模式下等待合并就绪结算窗口或人工审核；这些是互动站点。超过时间上限的检查卡在 `IN_PROGRESS` 上，以“CI 仍在运行”残差结束运行，而不是永远阻塞。
 
-The round/time budget is a coarse cost limit that catches a runaway. Prefer to stop *because the work is demonstrably not converging*. The next section covers how that is decided.
+round/time 预算是一个粗略的成本限制，可以防止失控。宁愿停下来*因为工作显然没有收敛*。下一节将介绍如何决定。
 
-## Non-convergence (trigger → route → park → re-open)
+## 不收敛（触发→路线→停车→重新开放）
 
-A loop can churn without finishing. Three shapes: CI **ping-pong** (fix A surfaces B, fix B brings A back, often an emergent trade-off); a review-bot **treadmill** (each commit spawns fresh nits); and **wrong-approach whack-a-mole** (each nit is valid, but the approach, say a regex, is the problem). A raw attempt counter cannot tell these apart from *legitimate progress* (four independent failures, each fixed once). So the decision is agent reasoning over the trajectory, and the split of responsibilities is strict:
+循环可能会在未完成的情况下搅动。三种形状：CI **乒乓球**（修复A表面B，修复B使A恢复，通常是一个紧急的权衡）；审查机器人**跑步机**（每次提交都会产生新的尼特）；和 **错误方法打地鼠**（每个 nit 都是有效的，但方法，比如正则表达式，是问题所在）。原始尝试计数器无法将这些与“合法进度”区分开来（四个独立的失败，每个失败一次）。所以决策是代理对轨迹进行推理，并且职责划分是严格的：
 
-- **`pr-snapshot` (babysit) reports facts.** The `trajectory` block is deterministic and coarse. `check_recur_max`/`recurring_checks` count a check that failed, cleared, then failed again on a *new* head; same-head flapping is excluded, so this is not flaky noise. `unresolved_trend` + `new_threads_this_tick` show a growing backlog and fresh threads arriving. `stream_alternations` counts ci↔review bouncing, which is cross-stream churn only babysit can see. `heads_since_progress` counts heads that moved without a new low in open problems. `invariant_rounds` counts resolver-supplied `invariant_key` values per unique head; the script never infers a key from paths, regexes, or comment text. Babysit **never** labels any of this "non-convergence."
-- **The leaf judges.** The leaf is the delegated skill for that tick: `ce-debug` for CI, `ce-resolve-pr-feedback` for review. When a trigger is crossed (the thresholds live only in `references/tick.md`), pass the trajectory to that tick's leaf as **mandatory input**, before it may fix, commit, or push. The leaf then does one of two things. It demonstrates progress by naming the invariant its next bounded fix resolves. Or it returns a `needs-human` that **parks the whole stream** (puts it on hold as a standing residual) with a `decision_context`: the tension or root cause, the options, their tradeoffs, and its lean.
-- **Invariant keys.** On a **fix** outcome the leaf returns a stable `invariant_key` for each root it fixed, associated with the items that root covered. The leaf does not run `pr-snapshot` and does not mark. Babysit persists each key on its existing dispatched mark (`--thread` / `--comment` plus `--invariant-key`). Unrelated keys stay independently actionable, and one- or two-round progress on a key is not a blocker.
+- **`pr-snapshot`（PR 看护）报告事实。** `trajectory` 块是确定性且粗糙的。 `check_recur_max`/`recurring_checks` 计算失败、清除、然后在*新*头上再次失败的检查；排除了同头拍动，因此这不是片状噪声。 `unresolved_trend` + `new_threads_this_tick` 显示积压不断增加，新线程到达。 `stream_alternations` 统计 ci↔ 评论跳出，这是只有PR 看护才能看到的跨流流失。 `heads_since_progress` 计算未解决问题中未创出新低的头数。 `invariant_rounds` 计算每个唯一头的解析器提供的 `invariant_key` 值；该脚本永远不会从路径、正则表达式或注释文本中推断出键。 Babysit **从不**给任何这种“不融合”贴上标签。
+- **叶子评委。** 叶子是该蜱的委托技能：`ce-debug`用于CI，`ce-resolve-pr-feedback`用于审查。当跨越触发器时（阈值仅存在于 `references/tick.md` 中），在修复、提交或推送之前，将轨迹作为 **强制输入** 传递到该蜱虫的叶子。然后叶子会做两件事之一。它通过命名其下一个有界修复解析的不变量来展示进展。或者它返回一个`needs-human`，**停放整个流**（将其作为常备残差搁置）和`decision_context`：张力或根本原因、选项、它们的权衡及其精益。
+- **不变键。** 在 **fix** 结果中，叶子为它修复的每个根返回一个稳定的`invariant_key`，与根覆盖的项目相关联。叶子不运行`pr-snapshot`并且不标记。 Babysit 将每个键保留在其现有的已调度标记上（`--thread` / `--comment` 加 `--invariant-key`）。不相关的密钥保持独立可操作，并且密钥上的一轮或两轮进展不会成为障碍。
 
-**The anti-cry-wolf line (put it to the leaf):** *progressive failure migration* (A fixed, B appears once, B fixed, done) is ordinary repair; **do not park.** *Oscillation* is non-convergence; park. Oscillation looks like any of these: A returns after B's fix; the failing set cycles; defects migrate X→Y→Z with the same invariant unsatisfied; or fix size grows superlinearly. "We've tried a lot" is never enough.
+**防狼叫线（放到叶子上）：** *渐进式故障迁移*（A固定，B出现一次，B固定，完成）为普通修复； **请勿停车。** *振荡*不收敛；公园。振荡看起来像以下任何一种： A 在 B 修复后返回；失败的设定周期；缺陷迁移X→Y→Z，且不满足相同的不变量；或固定大小超线性增长。 “我们已经尝试了很多”是远远不够的。
 
-**A third case the counter must not miss: a *correct* finding recurring across sibling sites.** Sometimes each new head brings a fresh thread that is *valid* and shares one root and one treatment with an already-fixed thread. That is not a wrong-approach cluster and not oscillation. It is one fix with a multi-site blast radius, surfacing one site per head. Fixing it one site per head is as wasteful as parking it is wrong. **Route it, don't decide it here:** pass the recurring feedback cluster **plus** the trajectory to `ce-resolve-pr-feedback` and request a **bounded-class assessment**. The resolver has the diff and makes the call. It decides whether the sites are genuinely equivalent (same invariant, same fix, only behavior this PR touched), enumerates the concrete locations, and fixes the class in one pass. Babysit does **not** infer the root or the sites from the `trajectory`; those are churn counts, not semantic identity. If the resolver judges the sites *not* equivalent, it falls back to per-site fixes. If it judges the shared root a wrong approach, it parks, as above.
+**计数器不能错过的第三种情况：在兄弟站点之间重复出现的“正确”发现。**有时，每个新头都会带来一个“有效”的新线程，并与已经固定的线程共享一个根和一个处理。这不是错误接近的集群，也不是振荡。这是一种具有多地点爆炸半径的修复方法，每个头可处理一个地点。为每个人修复一个站点就像错误地停车一样浪费。 **路由它，不要在这里决定它：**传递循环反馈集群**加上**到`ce-resolve-pr-feedback`的轨迹并请求**有界类评估**。解析器具有差异并进行调用。它决定站点是否真正等效（相同的不变量，相同的修复，仅涉及此PR的行为），枚举具体位置，并一次性修复类。 Babysit **不**从 `trajectory` 推断根或站点；这些是流失计数，而不是语义同一性。如果解析器判断站点*不*等效，则会回退到每个站点修复。如果它判断共享根的方法是错误的，它就会停止，如上所述。
 
-**Guards:**
+**守卫：**
 
-- **Moving-target ≠ non-convergence.** Base-branch merges, dependency bumps, flaky infra, and bot-rule changes create unrelated new failures. Recurrence already excludes same-SHA flapping. Still, do not park a failure the leaf attributes to an external cause rather than the approach.
-- **Cross-stream contradiction.** If `ce-debug` concludes the review-requested behavior is invalid while `ce-resolve-pr-feedback` concludes it is required, that is a single **cross-stream** residual. Do not arbitrarily park one side.
-- **A parked stream re-opens only through the decision lifetime below.** No stream has its own reopen rule.
+- **移动目标≠不收敛。** 基础分支合并、依赖关系碰撞、不稳定的基础设施和机器人规则更改会产生不相关的新故障。复发已经排除了相同 SHA 的抖动。尽管如此，不要将叶子归因于外部原因而不是方法的故障。
+- **跨流矛盾。** 如果 `ce-debug` 认为审核请求的行为无效，而 `ce-resolve-pr-feedback` 认为审核请求的行为是必需的，则为单个 **跨流** 残差。切勿随意将车停在一侧。
+- **停放的流仅在下面的决策生命周期内重新打开。**没有流有自己的重新打开规则。
 
-## On-disk state contract
+## 磁盘状态合约
 
